"c-sanguozhi-051-shao","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-shao"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yi:line041","text":"　　孫翊字叔弼，權弟也，驍悍果烈，有兄策風。太守朱治舉孝廉，司空辟。建安八年，以偏將軍領丹楊太守，時年二十。後卒為左右邊鴻所殺，鴻亦即誅。子松為射聲校尉、都鄉侯。黃龍三年卒。蜀丞相諸葛亮與兄瑾書曰：“既受東朝厚遇，依依於子弟。又子喬良器，為之惻愴。見其所與亮器物，感用流涕。”其悼松如此，由亮養子喬咨述故雲。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yi:line041:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"孫翊","kind":"person","person_id":"iyi_e4b_ig6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yi:line041:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"叔弼","kind":"person","person_id":"iyi_e4b_ig6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yi:line041:m0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yi:line041:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"策","kind":"person","person_id":"e9c_070_567","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yi:line041:m0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"朱治","kind":"person","person_id":"oix_a6t_ovk","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yi:line041:m0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"邊鴻","kind":"person","person_id":"rit_tr5_qrv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yi:line041:m0064","start":64,"end":65,"surface":"鴻","kind":"person","person_id":"rit_tr5_qrv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yi:line041:m0070","start":70,"end":71,"surface":"松","kind":"person","person_id":"0i3_922_5r6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-yi:line041:m0090","start":90,"end":93,"surface":"諸葛亮","kind":"person","person_id":"11e_f2d_5d2","status":"context